1
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,400
Move it.

2
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,280
Zhuang Cen said he's already

3
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,280
cleared it with Customs.

4
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,159
If anything happens, he'll cover for us.

5
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:08,520
We can't just hand them cash directly.

6
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,960
In China,

7
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,439
it's all about connections.

8
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:12,479
Without the right ties,

9
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,960
even if you give them money,

10
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,159
they wouldn't dare take it.

11
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:20,680
I think we should let Zhuang Cen handle it.

12
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,680
Got it, got it.

13
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,439
Don't worry.

14
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:28,439
We'll definitely be there on time tonight.

15
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:30,960
All right, all right.

16
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,120
Sir, the goods are loaded.

17
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,680
Ready to move out.

18
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,240
Good.

19
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:42,879
Get in.

20
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,000
Tony.

21
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:50,360
Mr. Theerade just said on the phone

22
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,759
that you should return to Country M.

23
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:54,560
You don't need to come along for this run.

24
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,680
All right. Stay safe on the road.

25
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,599
Be careful out there.

26
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:02,400
Mr. Theerade must have something important for you.

27
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,000
Make the most of this opportunity.

28
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,000
Thank you.

29
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,240
After you, Mr. Jiang.

30
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,960
Watch your step, Mr. Jiang.

31
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,319
Mr. Jiang.

32
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:14,680
Move those six crates of goods.

33
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:24,480
Come on, hurry up!

34
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:48,839
Theerade really called me away at the last minute.

35
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,279
Our Officer Zhuang

36
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,879
can really read them like a book.

37
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,720
Thanks for the compliment.

38
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,319
What's the latest from Officer Bai?

39
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,120
Everything Captain Bai wanted is in here.

40
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,160
Wen Qing has so many men around him.

41
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,519
How did you get this intel?

42
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:10,360
For our Ge Dan,

43
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:11,800
that's a piece of cake.

44
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:18,079
Ever since Tony joined Jiang Liye,

45
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,279
he's been getting closer to Wen Qing.

46
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,000
Once he learned about Wen Qing's back injury,

47
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:24,560
Tony recommended an acupuncture clinic to him.

48
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,319
Once inside the clinic,

49
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,360
Wen Qing was naturally separated from his men.

50
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:29,639
That's when

51
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:32,759
our great Dr. Ge stepped in.

52
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:36,600
Hold on a second.

53
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,920
The whole process went smoothly,

54
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,279
without a single hitch.

55
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:15,519
Don't forget,

56
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,639
convincing that pretty technician at the clinic

57
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:19,720
was thanks to me, too.

58
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,560
Who would've thought

59
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,360
Jiang Liye's deal

60
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,800
would take place out in the wilderness?

61
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,680
I wonder when

62
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,040
we'll finally catch that old fox.

63
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,600
Alright,

64
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:33,720
it's time for me to go face another fox.

65
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,920
Theerade asked us to attend a party

66
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:48,279
at Hesheng Manor tonight.

67
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,759
What a coincidence. I was just heading to Hesheng Manor.

68
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:59,079
Wen Qing should be crossing the border right about now.

69
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,319
Looks like a Trojan banquet.

70
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,279
Sir.

71
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,160
All set.

72
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:25,279
Stay safe on the road.

73
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,120
Get in.

74
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,159
Within a 100-kilometer radius,

75
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,159
there are only these few spots.

76
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,440
Captain.

77
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,279
Word just came in from Myitkyina.

78
00:08:52,519 --> 00:08:53,960
Jiang Liye will make the deal tonight at ten

79
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,159
at Hongjing Guanqiao Cement Plant.

80
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:05,279
Since Jiang Liye wants to pull a fast one,

81
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,480
let's catch him like a rat in a trap.

82
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,440
Tell all units to get ready.

83
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,200
We move out in ten minutes.

84
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:12,799
Yes, sir.

85
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,240
Welcome.

86
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:54,440
The other guests have been waiting for you.

87
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,440
This way, please.

88
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,159
My apologies, everyone.

89
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,799
Something came up for Mr. Theerade,

90
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,279
so he'll be a little late.

91
00:10:33,039 --> 00:10:34,200
If you need anything at all,

92
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,720
feel free to let me know anytime.

93
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,679
We leave it to our host.

94
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,120
Of course.

95
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,960
Sir, everyone has arrived.

96
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,879
Tell the chef

97
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:24,440
that tonight's meal

98
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,399
must be top-notch.

99
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:27,039
Yes, sir.

100
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,559
Tonight

101
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:35,399
might just be their Last Supper.

102
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,559
Hello, please show your ID.

103
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,679
What's in the truck?

104
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:23,320
Just some local specialties from Country M.

105
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,240
Let them through.

106
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:58,240
Sir, Wen Qing has crossed the border with the goods.

107
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,559
Brother Ma, look at all this food.

108
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:18,320
What are you waiting for?

109
00:13:18,879 --> 00:13:19,480
Sister-in-law,

110
00:13:20,679 --> 00:13:21,440
dig in.

111
00:13:26,679 --> 00:13:28,120
Come on, Xiaobai, eat up.

112
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,279
Brother Ma, why aren't you eating?

113
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,360
I'll wait a bit longer.

114
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:53,519
It's me.

115
00:14:55,559 --> 00:14:56,080
Clear.

116
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,320
Tell Mr. Theerade

117
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:02,240
that everything is going smoothly so far.

118
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:11,279
Tell the boys to speed it up.

119
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,000
It's almost time for the deal.

120
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,639
Yes, Mr. Jiang.

121
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:30,799
Brother Ma,

122
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:36,799
when will Mr. Theerade arrive?

123
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,559
My apologies, Mr. Ma.

124
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:43,279
Mr. Theerade only told me to take good care of you.

125
00:15:43,559 --> 00:15:44,639
As for anything else,

126
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,000
I know nothing about it.

127
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,240
We've imposed long enough.

128
00:15:51,519 --> 00:15:52,080
Excuse us.

129
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:53,080
How about this?

130
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,480
Next time we have the chance,

131
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:56,759
we'll impose on Mr. Theerade again.

132
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,440
No one leaves until Mr. Theerade arrives!

133
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,559
Put down your gun.

134
00:16:06,519 --> 00:16:07,960
These are all my guests.

135
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,279
How dare you be so rude!

136
00:16:10,279 --> 00:16:11,960
Being able to see Mr. Theerade today

137
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,399
was truly no easy feat.

138
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,320
My apologies to you all. Truly sorry.

139
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:18,559
An urgent matter came up, so forgive my neglect.

140
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:22,480
Did everyone enjoy tonight's dinner?

141
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:24,159
We loved it, very much so.

142
00:16:24,559 --> 00:16:25,600
Ever since coming to Country M,

143
00:16:25,679 --> 00:16:27,000
this has been the best meal we've had.

144
00:16:27,559 --> 00:16:28,320
Glad to hear that.

145
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,639
Then I'll be sure to invite you often

146
00:16:30,679 --> 00:16:32,000
to get together and share a meal.

147
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,679
Wonderful. Thank you, Mr. Theerade,

148
00:16:33,919 --> 00:16:35,960
for allowing us on such a lovely evening

149
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,279
to gather together.

150
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:39,120
As far as I'm concerned,

151
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,519
you are all like family to me.

152
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:43,799
For family to get together and share a meal,

153
00:16:43,879 --> 00:16:44,840
it's only natural.

154
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,879
Since Mr. Theerade put it that way,

155
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:48,440
and the food at your estate is so delicious,

156
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,240
we'll gladly come whenever invited.

157
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:53,320
Good. But it's me who should thank you.

158
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:55,120
I'd also like to trouble you

159
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,720
to invite someone over for dinner.

160
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,200
Just name them.

161
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:02,240
Boss Shen Xinru, whom you mentioned last time.

162
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,679
I'd like to meet with him.

163
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:06,160
I wonder when that can be arranged.

164
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,400
Since Mr. Theerade has requested it,

165
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,079
I will certainly do my best.

166
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:13,000
Good. Then I'll wait for your good news.

167
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,720
Let's have some dessert.

168
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,839
Sure, sounds good.

169
00:17:17,559 --> 00:17:19,039
Come on, take a seat.

170
00:17:26,839 --> 00:17:28,160
I have to say, the two of you back there

171
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:29,599
were way too calm!

172
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:33,240
If anything had gone wrong with Wen Qing on the way,

173
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:35,240
then we...

174
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:36,640
we'd all be dead!

175
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,519
Among everyone dining there tonight,

176
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,799
not a single person was truly calm.

177
00:17:41,319 --> 00:17:42,039
No way.

178
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:44,440
Looked to me like you had quite an appetite.

179
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,599
I treated that as The Last Supper,

180
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:50,039
so I wanted to eat well and eat my fill.

181
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,799
Besides, inside the villa today,

182
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,079
dozens of guns were aimed right at us.

183
00:17:57,079 --> 00:17:58,440
I was merely putting on an act.

184
00:18:02,799 --> 00:18:04,400
You knew guns were pointed at us,

185
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,160
so why didn't you tell us?

186
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:07,519
If I had told you,

187
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:08,759
we'd be dead by now.

188
00:18:10,079 --> 00:18:11,720
Thankfully, we made it out safely.

189
00:18:12,319 --> 00:18:12,839
Now...

190
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:15,680
Jiang Liye could never have imagined,

191
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,160
nor could he have anticipated,

192
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,440
that we'd have his whereabouts tracked.

193
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:58,640
Mr. Jiang.

194
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,960
That should be Boss Liu and his men.

195
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:35,839
Boss Jiang.

196
00:19:38,359 --> 00:19:40,119
Boss Liu. Hope you've been well.

197
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,200
Long time no see.

198
00:19:42,079 --> 00:19:43,559
I've missed you like crazy.

199
00:19:46,039 --> 00:19:47,799
The money's been ready for a while.

200
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,960
Where are the goods I asked for?

201
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,480
The purest goods are all ready for you.

202
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,319
The money and goods are settled.

203
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,200
See you around.

204
00:20:20,599 --> 00:20:21,559
Pleasure doing business.

205
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,039
We are the China Border Anti-Narcotics Brigade,

206
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,079
Special Operations Team.

207
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,039
You are suspected of

208
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,759
engaging in drug trafficking.

209
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,000
Drop your weapons

210
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:30,680
and cooperate with the police investigation!

211
00:20:41,599 --> 00:20:42,000
Run!

212
00:20:42,279 --> 00:20:43,000
Run! Move, hurry!

213
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,079
You are surrounded!

214
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:05,440
Do not put up futile resistance!

215
00:21:05,599 --> 00:21:07,519
Drop your weapons and surrender!

216
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:14,359
All units, prepare to breach!

217
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,200
Copy that.

218
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,240
Snipers, stand by.

219
00:21:16,319 --> 00:21:16,640
Yes, sir.

220
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:37,920
Apprehend the suspects!

221
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:38,839
Do not resist!

222
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:39,359
Move!

223
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:40,480
Move!

224
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,559
Boys, we're dead either way!

225
00:21:51,799 --> 00:21:52,759
Charge out with me!

226
00:21:56,759 --> 00:21:57,200
Don't move!

227
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,279
What are you doing?

228
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,640
Police! Drop your gun!

229
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:09,279
You...

230
00:22:31,359 --> 00:22:32,359
Mr. Theerade,

231
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,039
we've got trouble here.

232
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,079
What?

233
00:22:35,799 --> 00:22:36,400
What happened?

234
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,559
Boss Liu's man is a mole.

235
00:22:40,079 --> 00:22:41,559
We're surrounded by the police.

236
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:44,319
I don't think we're making it out this time.

237
00:23:00,319 --> 00:23:01,400
Take care, sir.

238
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,799
Cease your futile resistance!

239
00:23:10,799 --> 00:23:12,720
Drop your weapons and surrender.

240
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:49,359
By the way,

241
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,599
now that something happened to Jiang Liye,

242
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:54,680
will that old fox Theerade

243
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:57,079
suspect us?

244
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,279
He won't.

245
00:23:59,519 --> 00:24:00,519
As far as Theerade is concerned,

246
00:24:00,599 --> 00:24:01,680
we only knew Jiang Liye

247
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:04,000
went to Jiangyang to deal with Li Kexin.

248
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:07,079
Whatever happened to Jiang Liye in Hongjing

249
00:24:07,359 --> 00:24:08,960
has nothing to do with us.

250
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:13,279
Besides, even if Theerade gets suspicious,

251
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:17,039
he can only suspect the other side of the deal.

252
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:21,160
Plus, beside Boss Liu who dealt with Jiang Liye,

253
00:24:21,359 --> 00:24:22,839
we have an undercover officer, too.

254
00:24:24,039 --> 00:24:26,200
And before he got arrested,

255
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:29,599
Jiang Liye must have already sent word to Theerade.

256
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:31,400
Zhuang,

257
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:33,799
such crucial intel...

258
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,519
Why didn't you tell me?

259
00:24:36,039 --> 00:24:37,359
Aren't we partners?

260
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:38,920
The Border Anti-Narcotics Brigade

261
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,319
has had their eyes on Boss Liu for a while.

262
00:24:41,119 --> 00:24:42,920
They were just waiting to find his supplier.

263
00:24:43,559 --> 00:24:44,799
No one expected

264
00:24:44,799 --> 00:24:46,599
they'd catch both him and Jiang Liye in one fell swoop.

265
00:24:54,039 --> 00:24:57,160
With Jiang Liye busted by the Chinese police,

266
00:24:57,880 --> 00:25:00,279
Theerade will have to rely on you.

267
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,799
That means my mission is done!

268
00:25:04,599 --> 00:25:05,079
Pull over.

269
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:07,240
You're getting ahead of yourself.

270
00:25:07,759 --> 00:25:08,759
What kind of man is Theerade?

271
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:11,079
He'd rather kill a thousand by mistake than let one go.

272
00:25:12,039 --> 00:25:13,480
Until he's behind bars,

273
00:25:13,799 --> 00:25:15,000
don't even think about slipping away.

274
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:16,880
You...

275
00:25:18,319 --> 00:25:19,039
Fine, you win.

276
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:23,680
Now it's Boss Shen's turn to take the stage.

277
00:25:43,079 --> 00:25:43,640
What are you doing?!

278
00:25:44,039 --> 00:25:44,599
Get away!

279
00:25:45,359 --> 00:25:46,000
Get off me!

280
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:48,680
Let go!

281
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:53,519
Stop it!

282
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:55,440
Help! Li Xiao!

283
00:25:58,720 --> 00:25:59,960
Help me!

284
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,480
Stop!

285
00:26:05,559 --> 00:26:06,599
Let go of me!

286
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:07,119
Help!

287
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:09,839
Piyazi!

288
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,599
Piyazi!

289
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:31,920
What are you doing?

290
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:34,720
What's wrong?

291
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,319
Didn't the boss say

292
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,319
no one is allowed to touch this woman?

293
00:26:47,839 --> 00:26:48,440
Boss?

294
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:53,000
You talking to me?

295
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,240
Who's your boss anyway?

296
00:26:55,799 --> 00:26:57,799
Brother Dong, calm down.

297
00:26:59,359 --> 00:27:00,000
Four-Legged Snake!

298
00:27:00,079 --> 00:27:02,480
Am I losing my cool, or is he?

299
00:27:03,359 --> 00:27:05,799
He keeps protecting this woman. Something's off.

300
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:09,400
Stop it!

301
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:17,759
Boss, what brings you here?

302
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,799
I know your brother passed away,

303
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:23,200
and I understand how you feel.

304
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:26,359
But you can't keep taking it out on the boys.

305
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:28,359
I just find this punk suspicious.

306
00:27:28,839 --> 00:27:29,559
Otherwise, why would he

307
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:30,960
care so much about that woman?

308
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:38,319
I'm keeping these two because they're useful.

309
00:27:41,799 --> 00:27:42,680
You did the right thing.

310
00:27:43,359 --> 00:27:44,079
Thank you, Boss.

311
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,640
Long time no see.

312
00:27:54,079 --> 00:27:54,799
And you are...?

313
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,680
You don't recognize me?

314
00:27:58,920 --> 00:28:01,119
You helped me back in Nanhai.

315
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,960
She's Chameleon.

316
00:28:07,359 --> 00:28:09,160
Back then, a single word from her saved your life.

317
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:11,160
Otherwise, you'd be dead by now.

318
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,799
So you were the one who saved me all along.

319
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:15,039
Thank you, Brother Long.

320
00:28:16,279 --> 00:28:17,319
Don't call me Brother Long.

321
00:28:17,559 --> 00:28:19,079
I was only Chameleon in Nanhai.

322
00:28:19,759 --> 00:28:20,839
From now on, call me Miss Gu.

323
00:28:21,319 --> 00:28:22,160
Thank you, Miss Gu.

324
00:28:46,519 --> 00:28:47,839
This entire mountain forest

325
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,319
is our plantation.

326
00:28:50,119 --> 00:28:53,599
This area borders Country M and Country L,

327
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,759
lying in an ungoverned zone.

328
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,759
How much we grow

329
00:28:58,200 --> 00:28:59,319
is entirely up to us.

330
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:02,319
However many goods Boss Shen can move a year,

331
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,319
we can produce just as much.

332
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:08,440
Xiao Zhuang mentioned before

333
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,839
how powerful Mr. Theerade is,

334
00:29:10,119 --> 00:29:11,319
and I was a bit skeptical.

335
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:13,200
Seeing it today,

336
00:29:13,319 --> 00:29:16,319
Mr. Theerade truly lives up to his reputation.

337
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:20,480
I wonder how Mr. Theerade's goods

338
00:29:20,839 --> 00:29:23,319
are graded on the market?

339
00:29:25,839 --> 00:29:27,799
Mr. Shen, please come inspect the plant.

340
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:28,960
Alright.

341
00:30:25,039 --> 00:30:26,160
The goods we produce now

342
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:28,319
are all over 98% in purity,

343
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:32,119
and are considered Grade-A on the global market.

344
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,440
Come, Boss Shen.

345
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,480
Over there is our goods inspection area.

346
00:30:43,319 --> 00:30:45,279
All goods undergo rigorous inspection,

347
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:48,000
so quality is fully guaranteed.

348
00:30:49,519 --> 00:30:50,759
There's one thing I'm curious about.

349
00:30:51,240 --> 00:30:52,640
Since Mr. Theerade

350
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:54,160
has such a great source of goods,

351
00:30:54,359 --> 00:30:55,920
he shouldn't be short of buyers.

352
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:57,200
How does it fall to

353
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:59,599
someone like me, Shen Xinru, to make this money?

354
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:02,000
Mr. Theerade had concerns

355
00:31:02,079 --> 00:31:03,680
regarding The Four Great Families,

356
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:06,279
so with Southeast Asian clients...

357
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:10,640
My subordinate doesn't know any better.

358
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,480
Don't mind him, Boss Shen.

359
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,920
Boss Ma is just outspoken.

360
00:31:16,079 --> 00:31:16,799
I like that.

361
00:31:18,359 --> 00:31:19,240
Truth be told,

362
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,119
our family in Country M

363
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:23,279
is indeed being sidelined by The Four Great Families.

364
00:31:23,759 --> 00:31:24,799
However, The Four Great Families

365
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,480
don't have direct dealings

366
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,440
with distributors in mainland China.

367
00:31:27,519 --> 00:31:29,680
So it won't affect our partnership at all.

368
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:32,319
It has no impact right now,

369
00:31:32,839 --> 00:31:34,880
but who knows about the future?

370
00:31:35,839 --> 00:31:37,200
I'm just a businessman.

371
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:41,039
I just want to make my money in peace.

372
00:31:42,039 --> 00:31:44,640
I certainly don't want to get tangled up

373
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:46,039
with gangs in Country M.

374
00:31:48,039 --> 00:31:49,440
Then again,

375
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:51,960
high risk means high reward.

376
00:31:52,359 --> 00:31:53,559
I understand that much.

377
00:31:54,319 --> 00:31:55,519
In that case,

378
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:58,599
I'll still use my group's name

379
00:31:58,680 --> 00:32:00,119
to buy into your company,

380
00:32:00,119 --> 00:32:02,559
and get goods from you

381
00:32:02,559 --> 00:32:03,519
at the price we agreed on before.

382
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,119
But I have one condition.

383
00:32:06,519 --> 00:32:10,400
I want an extra 20% cut every year.

384
00:32:12,400 --> 00:32:15,920
What do you think, Mr. Theerade?

385
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:20,759
Boss Shen, you only know the Chinese market.

386
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:23,960
As for the other steps in the heroin trade,

387
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:25,480
you probably don't know much.

388
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:28,000
Buying in isn't out of the question,

389
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:30,960
but I'm afraid it would be too taxing for you.

390
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,440
Since we're partnering up,

391
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:35,200
I need to have control

392
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:36,640
over every step of the process.

393
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:40,119
Though I might not manage it personally,

394
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:41,920
from production to sales,

395
00:32:42,519 --> 00:32:45,720
I must assign people to oversee every stage.

396
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:53,480
This condition of yours, Boss Shen,

397
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:56,079
puts me in a difficult spot.

398
00:32:58,200 --> 00:33:00,720
Don't worry, Mr. Theerade.

399
00:33:01,839 --> 00:33:04,200
I have no intention to usurp your place.

400
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:06,440
I just want to buy some insurance

401
00:33:06,559 --> 00:33:07,839
for my own enterprise.

402
00:33:08,279 --> 00:33:09,319
Besides, I also hope

403
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:12,039
our business keeps expanding.

404
00:33:12,319 --> 00:33:14,799
We're both in the same boat,

405
00:33:15,039 --> 00:33:18,400
so why draw lines between us?

406
00:33:20,279 --> 00:33:22,759
Since you're willing to share the boat with me,

407
00:33:23,039 --> 00:33:25,240
I should naturally grant your wish, Boss Shen.

408
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,680
However, having you send people over

409
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,880
might cause too many inconveniences.

410
00:33:30,319 --> 00:33:30,960
How about this?

411
00:33:31,680 --> 00:33:33,079
I'll designate a person

412
00:33:33,079 --> 00:33:35,240
to keep you updated on all our moves.

413
00:33:35,319 --> 00:33:36,000
What do you think?

414
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:37,279
Your person?

415
00:33:40,519 --> 00:33:42,440
Will your person really be open with me?

416
00:33:51,079 --> 00:33:51,680
Xiao Zhuang.

417
00:33:52,559 --> 00:33:54,359
Xiao Zhuang introduced us.

418
00:33:54,799 --> 00:33:56,119
If you don't trust my men,

419
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:57,880
you surely trust Xiao Zhuang.

420
00:33:58,000 --> 00:33:59,279
Xiao Zhuang will be fully responsible

421
00:33:59,279 --> 00:34:00,799
for briefing you on everything.

422
00:34:01,559 --> 00:34:03,480
Are you satisfied with that?

423
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,000
Fine.

424
00:34:15,199 --> 00:34:16,239
We'll do it your way.

425
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:17,320
Good.

426
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:19,480
Here's to a fruitful partnership.

427
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:22,440
To our partnership.

428
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:29,320
Xiao Zhuang, show Mr. Shen around.

429
00:34:31,239 --> 00:34:32,360
Mr. Shen, please.

430
00:34:32,360 --> 00:34:33,239
Come, this way, please.

431
00:34:56,679 --> 00:34:57,800
Mr. Theerade...

432
00:34:58,280 --> 00:34:59,639
If you keep your mouth shut,

433
00:35:00,039 --> 00:35:01,400
no one will think you're mute.

434
00:35:03,039 --> 00:35:06,920
I'm sorry. I just wanted to look at it from your side

435
00:35:07,039 --> 00:35:08,199
and speak up on your behalf.

436
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:10,719
After all, I was the one who introduced Shen Xinru.

437
00:35:11,039 --> 00:35:11,519
So?

438
00:35:11,679 --> 00:35:12,800
"Speak up on my behalf"?

439
00:35:14,199 --> 00:35:15,280
Say what for me?

440
00:35:16,440 --> 00:35:17,840
All my bargaining chips are gone!

441
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:20,440
And another thing:

442
00:35:21,239 --> 00:35:22,679
was Shen Xinru really introduced by you?

443
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:23,760
It was Xiao Zhuang.

444
00:35:24,599 --> 00:35:25,840
If it weren't for Xiao Zhuang,

445
00:35:26,079 --> 00:35:27,280
would I even be doing business with him?

446
00:35:27,719 --> 00:35:29,920
I was wrong. It won't happen again.

447
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:31,440
Sir.

448
00:35:32,719 --> 00:35:34,280
Boss Shen and his people are setting off for Jiangyang.

449
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,440
Should we see them off?

450
00:35:37,079 --> 00:35:38,719
Fine. I'll see him off myself.

451
00:35:39,320 --> 00:35:39,880
You come with me.

452
00:35:42,239 --> 00:35:42,960
You stay behind.

453
00:35:45,239 --> 00:35:45,960
You too.

454
00:35:46,800 --> 00:35:47,239
Let's go.

455
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,920
Now that Theerade has lost Jiang Liye,

456
00:36:11,599 --> 00:36:13,039
even his tone has softened up a lot.

457
00:36:15,840 --> 00:36:16,400
Yeah.

458
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:19,159
We can now say we've successfully

459
00:36:19,239 --> 00:36:20,960
infiltrated Theerade's syndicate.

460
00:36:21,840 --> 00:36:22,880
From now on, evidence of his crimes

461
00:36:23,559 --> 00:36:24,800
will be completely within our grasp.

462
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:28,960
Then we can wrap up this mission soon.

463
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:34,199
Don't get too optimistic just yet.

464
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:37,079
It's not just about evidence of his crimes.

465
00:36:37,519 --> 00:36:39,679
More importantly, we need to know,

466
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:40,880
inside his factories,

467
00:36:41,239 --> 00:36:42,320
how his armed forces are deployed,

468
00:36:43,239 --> 00:36:45,000
so that when both countries take action,

469
00:36:45,239 --> 00:36:46,599
we can minimize our losses

470
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:47,920
and complete the mission.

471
00:36:48,679 --> 00:36:49,239
Understood.

472
00:36:50,639 --> 00:36:52,159
Although we've hit some bumps on our end,

473
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,119
things have gone relatively smoothly.

474
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:56,519
What about Li Xiao?

475
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,719
Still no word from him?

476
00:37:18,719 --> 00:37:19,719
Boss.

477
00:37:19,719 --> 00:37:21,039
What brought you here so suddenly?

478
00:37:22,239 --> 00:37:23,360
If I hadn't come back,

479
00:37:23,679 --> 00:37:25,159
the men would've staged a revolt.

480
00:37:26,480 --> 00:37:27,360
I've told you time and again

481
00:37:28,719 --> 00:37:30,880
not to act so rashly.

482
00:37:31,360 --> 00:37:33,679
We're not like the drug traffickers of the past.

483
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:36,280
We must operate professionally, like a corporation.

484
00:37:37,559 --> 00:37:39,639
Can't you keep your temper under control?

485
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:40,840
Being this reckless

486
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,440
will ruin my plans.

487
00:37:43,239 --> 00:37:43,800
Boss,

488
00:37:45,119 --> 00:37:46,480
the man who died was my own brother!

489
00:37:46,519 --> 00:37:47,880
Of course I want revenge!

490
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:50,840
Does that mean you can throw everything away for revenge?

491
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:53,599
If you touch Theerade's men right now,

492
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:55,840
it means an open war with them.

493
00:37:56,719 --> 00:37:59,079
That gives The Four Great Families a chance to swoop in,

494
00:37:59,159 --> 00:38:00,880
and everything I worked so hard to build here

495
00:38:01,119 --> 00:38:02,039
will be destroyed in an instant.

496
00:38:02,239 --> 00:38:03,599
Have you even factored that in?

497
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:05,039
You have an MBA.

498
00:38:05,159 --> 00:38:06,000
I don't.

499
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:07,360
All I know is, whoever owes me,

500
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,480
I'll collect what's mine.

501
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:11,440
Don't worry.

502
00:38:11,639 --> 00:38:13,760
I'll make things right for Xiangnan.

503
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:16,639
The lives of Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu?

504
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:19,519
I'll make Theerade hand them over himself.

505
00:38:19,679 --> 00:38:22,360
Didn't you say we wouldn't go to war with Theerade?

506
00:38:23,199 --> 00:38:25,559
I never said I was going to war with him.

507
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:27,000
I'm going to be his friend.

508
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:29,599
Friends?

509
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:31,000
With your status,

510
00:38:31,519 --> 00:38:32,719
without men, without guns...

511
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:34,039
How are you going to approach Theerade?

512
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,000
In two days, I'm heading back to Country M

513
00:38:37,239 --> 00:38:38,320
for a gathering with some friends.

514
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:39,320
One of them

515
00:38:39,679 --> 00:38:41,440
will arrange a meeting with him for me.

516
00:38:41,679 --> 00:38:42,519
All right.

517
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:44,480
I'll send more men with you then.

518
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,440
I'm going there to discuss business.

519
00:38:48,079 --> 00:38:49,440
Why would I bring so many men?

520
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:51,199
Rest assured.

521
00:38:51,639 --> 00:38:54,039
In a few days, those two lives...

522
00:38:54,159 --> 00:38:56,800
Theerade will hand them to me like a gift.

523
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:57,920
All right, all right, all right.

524
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:38,360
Never seen a pretty girl swim?

525
00:41:39,480 --> 00:41:40,440
What are you talking about?

526
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:45,920
What, someone gets jealous and you're still unhappy?

527
00:41:53,199 --> 00:41:54,239
I'm going to get changed too.

528
00:41:54,280 --> 00:41:55,159
I'm going for a swim as well.

529
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,559
I don't believe I can't look as good.

530
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:58,880
Women are such a hassle.

531
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,639
They're all the same, let me tell you.

532
00:42:08,000 --> 00:42:09,400
Sun, sand...

533
00:42:10,599 --> 00:42:11,320
...and a beautiful woman.

534
00:42:12,039 --> 00:42:13,199
Life is good.

535
00:42:13,760 --> 00:42:15,400
If only it could stay like this forever.
